0 HEAD
1 SOUR gedcom-go
2 VERS 1.0.0
2 NAME gedcom-go test suite
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 NOTE SEX value variant test file.
2 CONT Original work written from the GEDCOM 5.5.1 structure rules for issue #301.
2 CONT Exercises every SEX payload variant: the 5.5.1 values M/F/U, the 7.0-only
2 CONT value X appearing in a 5.5.1 file, an empty payload, a lowercase value,
2 CONT and an individual with no SEX line at all.
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Standard /Male/
1 SEX M
0 @I2@ INDI
1 NAME Standard /Female/
1 SEX F
0 @I3@ INDI
1 NAME Unknown /Sex/
1 SEX U
0 @I4@ INDI
1 NAME Nonbinary /InLegacyFile/
1 SEX X
1 NOTE SEX X is only defined in GEDCOM 7.0; invalid-but-tolerated in 5.5.1
0 @I5@ INDI
1 NAME Empty /SexPayload/
1 SEX
0 @I6@ INDI
1 NAME Lowercase /SexPayload/
1 SEX m
0 @I7@ INDI
1 NAME No /SexLine/
0 TRLR
